1
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:21,760
I need to get out of here.

2
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,199
This guy is unpredictable.

3
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:24,640
I need to keep myself safe.

4
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:26,600
Nice.

5
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:28,440
My palace is still the most comfortable.

6
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:33,439
But

7
00:00:34,479 --> 00:00:35,640
since I'm here,

8
00:00:36,759 --> 00:00:38,280
it's not appropriate

9
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:39,280
to go back empty-handed.

10
00:01:08,959 --> 00:01:10,319
Just think of it as compensation for emotional distress.

11
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,239
What a coincidence.

12
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,280
Where are you heading to, Lady Feng?

13
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:20,040
Back to the cold palace.

14
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,840
I still have a manuscript to submit.

15
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,280
Please.

16
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,040
The Crown Prince wants to see you.

17
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,400
Are you guys ever going to stop?

18
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:24,560
What are you up to this time?

19
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,599
What's the new game now?

20
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:29,520
Phoenix,

21
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,120
we meet again so soon.

22
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,759
Boss,

23
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,000
is your entrance

24
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,840
supposed to be a role-playing as bacon?

25
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:41,719
You...

26
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,759
What are you waiting for?

27
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,199
Hurry up and put me down!

28
00:02:44,439 --> 00:02:45,639
If my delicate skin

29
00:02:45,719 --> 00:02:46,599
If it gets hurt,

30
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,719
can you afford it?

31
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:48,360
Fu Yi.

32
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,280
Lady Feng.

33
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:49,919
It's none of your business.

34
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:50,759
Go away.

35
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,599
I've always treated you as my confidant.

36
00:02:59,159 --> 00:03:00,080
Why didn't you tell me

37
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,400
when something so big happened?

38
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,719
Little Phoenix.

39
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:07,520
Soul split, one body with multiple souls.

40
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,199
Do you believe it when I say it?

41
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:11,360
If they know,

42
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,039
they would burn us

43
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:13,960
as demons first.

44
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,120
And the host

45
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:18,240
of this body

46
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,919
is the Crown Prince.

47
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:22,080
You let me draw those picture books,

48
00:03:22,479 --> 00:03:23,639
and draw you like that.

49
00:03:25,639 --> 00:03:26,479
I just thought

50
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,719
if these books spread far enough,

51
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,199
causing a stir in the court,

52
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,120
maybe it would prevent Gu Jiachen

53
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,639
from ever taking the throne.

54
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,680
So,

55
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:36,919
you want to use this method

56
00:03:37,439 --> 00:03:38,439
to free yourself.

57
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,319
It's our freedom.

58
00:03:44,039 --> 00:03:44,680
Phoenix,

59
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,439
haven't you also saved up enough money

60
00:03:46,599 --> 00:03:47,719
to leave the palace?

61
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,560
You're always

62
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,639
laughing and joking,

63
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:54,479
saying how free and easy it is here,

64
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,599
with food and housing provided.

65
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,039
It's like a dream come true.

66
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:59,639
But every time you paint,

67
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,120
your eyes can't help

68
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,840
but wander.

69
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,800
You keep flipping through

70
00:04:05,439 --> 00:04:06,199
your travel diary,

71
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:07,759
the edges are worn out.

72
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:09,919
You said

73
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,479
you wanted to leave the palace.

74
00:04:12,639 --> 00:04:13,400
Actually, it's just right.

75
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,120
I've dreamed about it several times.

76
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,720
One day,

77
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,160
we'll leave the palace together.

78
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,759
In March, we'll go to Yangzhou.

79
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,720
First, we'll see the willows of the Slender West Lake.

80
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:23,920
Then we'll go west to the frontier.

81
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,600
Ride horses for a day and night.

82
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:28,040
Ride until we can't see the palace walls.

83
00:04:29,639 --> 00:04:30,519
But all of this

84
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,199
is only possible if we

85
00:04:33,199 --> 00:04:33,920
leave the throne.

86
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:37,639
What? Are you touched?

87
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,800
I haven't finished yet.

88
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,800
I'll take you with me.

89
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,360
You'll be my maid.

90
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,720
Serving tea, making beds.

91
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,959
I'll eat meat and you'll drink soup.

92
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,480
I'll ride a horse and you'll walk.

93
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,800
Of course,

94
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,680
you have to enjoy the good life with me.

95
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:54,360
Get lost.

96
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,040
Who wants to be your maid?

97
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,199
But,

98
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,680
didn't you always say

99
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,839
you liked a girl?

100
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,920
What about her if we leave?

101
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,439
I have to take the girl

102
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:08,279
I like with me.

103
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,160
That's enough.

104
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:19,399
You

105
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:20,720
kiss him.

106
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:23,680
What?

107
00:05:25,439 --> 00:05:26,439
Kiss him.

108
00:05:26,959 --> 00:05:27,879
Kiss?

109
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:29,199
Don't you understand?

110
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:30,560
Kiss.

111
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,120
Don't be ridiculous.

112
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,560
You want me to kiss him

113
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,480
for no reason?

114
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,160
Why?

115
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,439
There's no time to explain.

116
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,319
Just kiss him first.

117
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:38,839
Shen Li.

118
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,040
Good job.

119
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,199
Phoenix,

120
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:44,439
I'll let you have your way

121
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:45,319
this time.

122
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,439
This is the kiss of destiny.

123
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:48,839
If you don't do it,

124
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,600
the world will be in chaos.

125
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,839
Stop pretending to be mysterious.

126
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,279
You're asking for a beating.

127
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:54,600
Phoenix,

128
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:55,920
I'm begging you.

129
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:57,480
I'm so uncomfortable.

130
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,519
If you do it,

131
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,720
he may put me down.

132
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:01,839
No.

133
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,120
You woman,

134
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,839
how can you be so ungrateful?

135
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:08,279
This body is the Crown Prince.

136
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,319
So what?

137
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,480
Kiss him yourself.

138
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,160
Wait.

139
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,319
Kiss?

140
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,040
It seems that every time I kiss him,

141
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,000
Gu Jiachen comes back.

142
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,720
[Shen Li brought me here in such a hurry.]

143
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,240
[Could it be...]

144
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:26,519
[Could it be that Gu's dissociation]

145
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:28,279
[is more than just a physiological disorder?]

146
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,639
My kiss can help stabilize his personality.

147
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,759
What are you waiting for?

148
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:39,800
Kiss him now!

149
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,079
I don't know

150
00:06:42,079 --> 00:06:43,079
how it works,

151
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:45,319
but if it's true,

152
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:48,240
then this kiss isn't just

153
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,160
a simple gesture.

154
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,879
I want to make a deal.

155
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:53,120
Don't think about deals right now.

156
00:06:53,319 --> 00:06:54,439
Just kiss me.

157
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:01,639
Now it's you who are begging me.

158
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:09,519
Watch out!

159
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:13,920
This freak

160
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,720
killed our brothers.

161
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,160
Let's kill him together.

162
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:20,879
Phoenix, watch out!

163
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:21,639
I'll protect you.

164
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,279
Protect yourself first.

165
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:47,959
You are Ye Xuan?

166
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,519
Go away.

167
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:51,560
Don't get in the way.

168
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,279
How dare you

169
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,079
hurt her!

170
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,920
Yexuan, why are you out again?

171
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:32,679
Your life is mine.

172
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,480
Before I achieve my goal,

173
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,879
no one can hurt you.

174
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:39,080
You...

175
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,399
Get out.

176
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,399
Get out.

177
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,720
Why are you here?

178
00:08:50,039 --> 00:08:50,519
What?

179
00:08:51,759 --> 00:08:53,960
You are disappointed that it's not Gu Jichen?

180
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,200
What do you want to do?

181
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,759
I just thought you were interesting before.

182
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,399
I didn't expect

183
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,639
you to have such power.

184
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,639
You know that, too.

185
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:11,279
I'm not as slow as them.

186
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,480
I confirmed it

187
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,320
when we kissed in the water.

188
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:17,519
Feng Zhiwei, you are special.

189
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,080
Help me find a way

190
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,960
to kill the other souls.

191
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,840
When I take over this body,

192
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:26,440
I'll give you whatever you want.

193
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:27,639
I can't do that.

194
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:29,200
It's not up to you.

195
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:31,840
Since you can wake Gu Jiachen up,

196
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:34,039
you can kill him, too.

197
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,440
Waking him up

198
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:38,080
is different from killing others.

199
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,039
I can't do that.

200
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:41,000
If you refuse,

201
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:43,000
you'll never leave this place.

202
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:44,600
Bro,

203
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,759
did you learn that line from a script?

204
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,480
Are you going to say next,

205
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:50,559
"Woman,

206
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:51,960
you've successfully

207
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,320
caught my attention."

208
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:55,399
You've indeed caught my attention.

209
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,799
The power on your lips

210
00:09:58,320 --> 00:09:59,159
is the key

211
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,600
to controlling this body.

212
00:10:02,159 --> 00:10:02,559
Anyway,

213
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,120
I won't do anything bad for you.

214
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:07,000
Can't you just get along?

215
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:08,399
You share this body.

216
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,720
You're so familiar.

217
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:11,360
Why fight?

218
00:10:14,559 --> 00:10:15,519
Do you know

219
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:16,720
what it feels like

220
00:10:17,279 --> 00:10:18,759
to be locked in a dark place

221
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:21,200
for over a thousand days,

222
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,639
only hearing your heartbeat

223
00:10:23,039 --> 00:10:24,159
to confirm you're still alive?

224
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,519
I never want to be locked up again.

225
00:10:29,519 --> 00:10:30,639
This body

226
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,679
can only have one master.

227
00:10:33,639 --> 00:10:35,559
Either him or me.

228
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:40,840
Are you sure you won't help me?

229
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,039
What do you want?

230
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:48,039
I can't guarantee

231
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,840
what I will do to you.

232
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,799
You're threatening me, right?

233
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,240
Don't forget

234
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:57,639
who's in charge now.

235
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,000
You may leave now.

236
00:11:33,679 --> 00:11:34,159
Yes, Your Majesty.

237
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,320
Miss Feng,

238
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,679
how do you want to cooperate with me?

239
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,720
I can help you stabilize your personality.

240
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:49,720
As the Crown Prince,

241
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,679
I won't give you a chance

242
00:11:52,039 --> 00:11:53,399
to control me.

243
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,039
I won't control you.

244
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,919
I just want you to help me get out of the palace.

245
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:00,279
That's it?

246
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,840
Although I'm in the cold palace,

247
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,240
I still get some information.

248
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:05,879
Your Majesty is not in good health.

249
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:08,440
The royal physician said it's hard for him to survive this year.

250
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,519
Then I'll stay with you for a year

251
00:12:11,879 --> 00:12:12,960
to help you stabilize your personality.

252
00:12:13,919 --> 00:12:14,799
As for a year later,

253
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:15,919
whether you ascend the throne or not,

254
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,279
you have to let me leave the palace.

255
00:12:17,919 --> 00:12:19,080
Not as a discarded consort,

256
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,320
nor as a fugitive,

257
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,519
but as a truly free person.

258
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,080
With the vast sky and sea,

259
00:12:24,519 --> 00:12:25,720
I can travel wherever I wish.

260
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:27,919
But...

261
00:12:30,759 --> 00:12:31,559
If that's the case,

262
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,200
I have a more important condition.

263
00:12:35,679 --> 00:12:36,639
I knew

264
00:12:37,159 --> 00:12:38,080
you wouldn't easily let go

265
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,919
of such leverage.

266
00:12:43,759 --> 00:12:44,960
Should we discuss

267
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,000
the consultation fee separately?

268
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:49,960
Consultation fee?

269
00:12:51,759 --> 00:12:52,799
Ten taels each time.

270
00:12:53,519 --> 00:12:54,879
I need to paint for a living.

271
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,519
To make up for

272
00:12:56,639 --> 00:12:57,720
the slow production of my paintings,

273
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:59,000
I need some compensation.

274
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:00,000
Is that too much?

275
00:13:00,559 --> 00:13:02,159
Ten taels of gold?

276
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,600
Gold?

277
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,240
That's a bargain.

278
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,720
He's a good boy.

279
00:13:10,559 --> 00:13:12,120
Ten times a month,

280
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,600
ten taels each time.

281
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,159
Am I a genius?

282
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:19,360
If we're going to work together,

283
00:13:19,879 --> 00:13:21,360
I have a question for you.

284
00:13:22,759 --> 00:13:23,320
What is it?

285
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:25,399
After these days together,

286
00:13:25,879 --> 00:13:28,000
I find you don't seem surprised

287
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:30,399
by my condition.

288
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:34,639
Don't you think I'm a monster?

289
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:35,559
Monster?

290
00:13:36,559 --> 00:13:37,759
I don't know why

291
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,919
my kiss works on you,

292
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,320
but in my hometown,

293
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,440
your illness is just

294
00:13:41,519 --> 00:13:42,600
a common physiological disease.

